select app.guide_add_published_section('va', 'sales', 'add-a-rental-by-hand', 'Add a rental by hand', 'Choose the car and dates, find the renter, price it, record how it is paid.',
  'Customer service and Sales add rentals that come in by phone, at the counter, from Turo, a partner or an insurer. The rental is confirmed and on the calendar at once.

## Add a rental

Open **Add a rental** on your rail.

1. Choose the car, the dates and the places. The check shows any clash with another booking or with the cleaning time after a trip. You cannot book over a clash: ask an Admin.
2. Find the renter by name, email or phone, or add a new one with their name, email, phone, date of birth and licence. Add any other drivers.
3. Press **Check the calendar and the price**. The price comes from the rate sheet. You may add the extras, the coverage and an allowed promo code; a price typed by hand is for Admins.
4. Choose Where it came from and how it is paid. The ways open to you are set by an Admin, such as **Paid another way**, **Send a payment link** or **Charge the saved card**.
5. Press **Add the rental**. The renter gets the confirmation email unless you tick **Do not email the renter**.

> Tip: The renter signs the rental agreement in their portal before pickup. If they sign on paper at the counter, an Admin records it. A payment link keeps the booking waiting for payment.
',
  '<p class="gd-p">Customer service and Sales add rentals that come in by phone, at the counter, from Turo, a partner or an insurer. The rental is confirmed and on the calendar at once.</p><section class="gd-task" id="add-a-rental-by-hand-add-a-rental" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Add a rental</h2><p class="gd-p">Open <b class="gd-ui">Add a rental</b> on your rail.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Choose the car, the dates and the places. The check shows any clash with another booking or with the cleaning time after a trip. You cannot book over a clash: ask an Admin.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Find the renter by name, email or phone, or add a new one with their name, email, phone, date of birth and licence. Add any other drivers.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Check the calendar and the price</b>. The price comes from the rate sheet. You may add the extras, the coverage and an allowed promo code; a price typed by hand is for Admins.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Choose Where it came from and how it is paid. The ways open to you are set by an Admin, such as <b class="gd-ui">Paid another way</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Send a payment link</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Charge the saved card</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Add the rental</b>. The renter gets the confirmation email unless you tick <b class="gd-ui">Do not email the renter</b>.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>The renter signs the rental agreement in their portal before pickup. If they sign on paper at the counter, an Admin records it. A payment link keeps the booking waiting for payment.</div></aside></section>');
select app.guide_add_published_section('owner', 'documents-and-forms', 'for-partner-rental-companies', 'For partner rental companies', 'The partner portal, the partner agreement, statements and payouts.',
  'A partner rental company uses this same portal. CarmaCars rents out your cars, keeps its commission and pays you the rest each month.

## Your partner portal

1. Home shows your partner number, our commission and your cars. CarmaCars adds your cars once we agree which ones join.
2. Vehicles and Bookings show each car and its rentals. There are no program fees, so there is no Invoices page.
3. Statements and Payouts: a statement for each month and the payment of your share.

## Sign the partner agreement

Open **Partner agreement**.

1. Read the agreement. It is filled in from your partner record: your cars, our commission, your insurance and the payout day.
2. Something wrong? Tell us before you sign and we fix it.
3. Sign by drawing or typing your name. CarmaCars countersigns at once and the signed copy is in Documents.

> Tip: Prefer paper? Ask us for a copy, sign it and send us the scan. We record it and it counts the same.
',
  '<p class="gd-p">A partner rental company uses this same portal. CarmaCars rents out your cars, keeps its commission and pays you the rest each month.</p><section class="gd-task" id="for-partner-rental-companies-your-partner-portal" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your partner portal</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Home shows your partner number, our commission and your cars. CarmaCars adds your cars once we agree which ones join.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Vehicles and Bookings show each car and its rentals. There are no program fees, so there is no Invoices page.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Statements and Payouts: a statement for each month and the payment of your share.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="for-partner-rental-companies-sign-the-partner-agreement" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Sign the partner agreement</h2><p class="gd-p">Open <b class="gd-ui">Partner agreement</b>.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Read the agreement. It is filled in from your partner record: your cars, our commission, your insurance and the payout day.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Something wrong? Tell us before you sign and we fix it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Sign by drawing or typing your name. CarmaCars countersigns at once and the signed copy is in Documents.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Prefer paper? Ask us for a copy, sign it and send us the scan. We record it and it counts the same.</div></aside></section>');
